<head>
<style>
  div
  {
  border: silver solid 0.25em;
  color: blue;
  padding: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 3em;
  }
  
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div>1.
   <div>1.
    <div>1.</div>
   </div>
  </div>

  <p>The above should render like the example below.</p>

  <div>1.
   <div>1.
    <div>1.</div>
   </div>
  </div>

 
</body>
</html>
